00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.960
I'm positive that the real Kira-

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.530
Kira would want L to die. There's no way he'd make me stop.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:36.510
Yuzaki.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:36.950
Yes, like?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:41.010
I think you're mistaken. I would never do that if I were Kira.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:41.690
Why not?

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:46.910
Well, if you're L and I'm Kira, then I'd already know your personality pretty well.

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:51.170
L would never agree to appear on TV no matter what threat he was facing,

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.810
and he wouldn't allow someone else to die in his place.

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.650
The L I know would find some way to escape the situation.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.980
So, you figured it...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:06.210
Look, Light, you've got to stop that. I don't like hearing you say, if I were Kira, even hypothetically.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:12.750
Oh, I'm sorry, Dad. I just wanted to let Ryuzaki know exactly what I thought of his plan.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:18.950
I posed that scenario because I want to help solve this case. It's the only chance I have to clear my name.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:23.990
Besides, the only reason I feel comfortable saying things like that is because I'm not really Kira.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:29.900
That's a good point. You're not Kira. That is...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:38.170
It would be a problem if you were, Kira, because I feel you're the first friend that I have ever had.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:49.380
Yeah, I know what you mean. The two of us have a lot in common.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:59.970
And I have missed having you around at school. We should play tennis again.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.800
Yes, we should.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:48.100
with Misa. This is the first time in my life that I've been provoked to hit a woman. I just wanted

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:54.340
to see you so badly. Well, you might as well come over. Alfred.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:06.220
To see you, Misa. You and a whole bunch of magazines.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:07.840
Please, come on in.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.400
Sorry to drop by like this.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.260
Could you make us some tea, Mom?

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:20.350
Rem, you are Misa's ally, aren't you?

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:24.830
Yes. I'd seen her many times from the Shinigami realm,

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:29.380
and then certain events made me develop feelings for her.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:29.970
Feelings?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.360
but you're a Shinigami!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:36.160
You don't like what I said before about how I'd kill you

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:38.420
if you even attempted to kill Misa.

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:42.970
So, if Misa is happy, does that mean that you'll be happy as well?

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.750
I suppose you could say that.

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:47.600
I definitely don't want her to suffer.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:52.990
As you know, Misa loves me.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:59.970
Misa, if I was happy, would that make you happy too?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.780
Yes.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:05.760
Then could you ask Rem to kill El?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:12.800
Rem said that your happiness was important, but what do you think would happen if El caught one of us?

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:14.640
It means our happiness would be ruined.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:20.650
It's true that Shinigami are forbidden to give out a person's name to anyone.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.750
But then again, there's no rule that prevents Ren from killing anyone.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:29.830
That's right. And if you agree to kill L, it would only make me love Misa that much more.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.760
Plus, I'd be grateful to you.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.780
Most importantly, the two of us will be happy together.

00:20:37.548 --> 00:20:38.528
Bye to love me.

00:20:38.892 --> 00:20:40.852
And I know we could be happy together.

00:20:41.868 --> 00:20:42.908
That's all I ever wanted.

00:20:43.308 --> 00:20:45.308
You

00:20:53.132 --> 00:20:55.132
shame.

00:20:55.788 --> 00:20:56.228
Fine.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.960
As you wish, Light Yagami.

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.100
But I do not like you.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:06.260
This will not kill me even if it ends up lengthening your life.

00:21:07.228 --> 00:21:09.068
I will kill El for you.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.760
It really makes no difference. He is just another human to me.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:23.640
All it.

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:38.170
夢を見て 全て捨てた

00:22:39.596 --> 00:22:45.076
That's right. Ryuga revealed that he's L, therefore he must die. The game is over.

00:22:46.668 --> 00:22:51.808
Tomorrow will be El's, or at least Ryuga and Ryuzaki's last day alive.
